<title>USA: Loctite gives Henkel bid guidelines.</title>
<headline>Loctite gives Henkel bid guidelines.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Henkel KGaA said on Friday that Loctite Corp, which it is trying to buy, gave guidelines to Henkel for submitting a bid to acquire it.</p>
<p>In early November, Henkel, a German chemicals and consumer products group, launched a $57.75 per share bid for the 65 percent of Loctite it does not already own. However, Loctite, a U.S.-based adhesives maker, rejected the offer as financially inadequate.</p>
</text>
